      "name": "Merge manager watch: wake, read the queue live, route",
      "summary": "The loop run by the agent that holds the merge-steward lane (actor merge-manager, skill merge-manager-watcher), which coordinates with the swarm siblings whenever a batch lands.",
      "description": "The loop run by the agent that holds the merge-steward lane (actor merge-manager, skill merge-manager-watcher), which coordinates with the swarm siblings whenever a batch lands. Each wake reads the open PRs, the runner queue, main's verdict and the PR owners live, and routes to one sub-process. A wake with nothing to do ends with no message. Every merge on any route waits for the owner's own OK.",
